! STEOM-DLPNO-CCSD def2-SVP def2-SVP/C def2/J RIJCOSX TightSCF TightPNO
# Neutral (protonated) gas-phase chromophore, charge 0, closed-shell.
# SERIAL + modest memory: the parallel 8-rank run spikes past 62 GB RAM and gets OOM-killed.
# Serial (nprocs 1) keeps memory low AND tolerates any EA-EOM non-convergence.
%maxcore 12000
%pal nprocs 1 end
%mdci
  NRoots 3
  DoRootWise true
  DoStoreSTEOM true
  AddL2Term True
  TCutPNOSingles 1e-12
  NDav 400
  MaxIter 200
end
* xyzfile 0 1 neutral_chromophore.xyz
